<glyph name="eight" format="2">
  <advance width="703"/>
  <unicode hex="0038"/>
  <note>
A gently twisted waist, smaller upper eye and broad lower eye, rather than stacked capsules. Counter tips individually softened after large-size optical review.
Weight master: 特粗仍要能读：调制降到 0.40，内白下限是 Regular 的 0.42。M 的谷重新抬起，免得黑三角封死。字距转为正值。B 上眼明显小于下眼，这是比例决定，不是均匀内缩。
</note>
